# Build context hygiene. The image ships code only — never secrets, never local state, never the venv.

# --- secrets: must never enter an image layer ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- python / node build junk ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
api/brief_assets/node_modules/

# --- local state: the deployed app writes all of this to STUDIO_DATA_DIR, not the image ---
# (~730MB of dev test data + generated media if left in — and it would shadow nothing, just bloat)
api/tenants/
api/media/
api/renders/
api/edits/
api/library/
api/learning/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal

# --- handover / snapshot files, not runtime inputs ---
# NOTE: patterns here must not glob-match real modules. `research_*` once ate research_parse.py.
# Scratch research folders are dated (research_2026-08/ etc.); match only those.
**/research_[0-9]*/
api/frontend/parts/
api/frontend/app.dc.html.bak-*
api/frontend/app.dc.html.pre-*
app.dc.*.html
app.dc-*.html
ASK_DESIGN_*.md
HANDOVER_*.md
handover.md
ask-design-round*/
*.zip
.git/
.claude/

# --- safety net: real modules that share a name-prefix with an excluded data dir ---
# (a later !pattern wins; keep this list narrow — a broad !api/**/*.py would drag the venv back in)
!api/research_parse.py
!api/library.py
!api/learning.py
!api/media.py
